  "comment_b": "In credit card inquiries, verify the distinct functions of `minimum_payment` and `no_interest_payment`. Never tolerate claims that paying the minimum amount prevents interest from accruing, as minimum payments only satisfy periodic delinquency thresholds while the revolving balance continues to incur interest charges."
