  "comment_b": "In spending inquiries about unfamiliar charges, when identifying a transaction from the feed, it is appropriate to state its pending status and describe the merchant category based on known context. Acknowledging that itemized details (e.g., ticket or order numbers) are absent and offering dispute steps without falsely claiming the dispute is already finalized adheres to factual accuracy."
